WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.084 --> 01:44.136
=Episode 13=

01:46.270 --> 01:47.630
Why am I so unlucky?

02:00.550 --> 02:01.110
Hello.

02:02.190 --> 02:03.750
Xiaojue, it's Mengmeng.

02:04.431 --> 02:06.591
Mengmeng, what is it?

02:07.311 --> 02:09.190
I acted impulsively that day.

02:09.551 --> 02:11.831
After hearing the truth from Tiehan,

02:11.831 --> 02:13.711
I realized I had misunderstood you.

02:15.551 --> 02:16.311
It's fine.

02:16.991 --> 02:17.950
Just a misunderstanding.

02:19.790 --> 02:22.750
Actually,
I've thought it over carefully.

02:23.031 --> 02:23.950
This isn't

02:24.711 --> 02:26.991
entirely Huan'er's fault.

02:30.230 --> 02:32.031
Hey, Mengmeng, are you there?

02:32.136 --> 02:32.790
(Forgive me?)

02:32.790 --> 02:33.670
Yes, I'm here.

02:34.111 --> 02:35.871
Can you forgive me?

02:37.311 --> 02:38.431
Mengmeng, what do you mean?

02:38.431 --> 02:39.431
Don't mention that.

02:39.431 --> 02:40.591
We've acquainted for years,

02:41.190 --> 02:42.670
just let bygones be bygones, okay?

02:45.608 --> 02:47.111
(Ask him out)
Good then.

02:47.311 --> 02:48.151
Here's the thing.

02:48.271 --> 02:49.391
It's been a long time

02:49.391 --> 02:51.031
since we graduated and gathered.

02:51.190 --> 02:53.431
We're going to host a class reunion.

02:53.431 --> 02:54.670
Can you come?

02:55.311 --> 02:56.031
I...

02:57.431 --> 02:59.230
I want to ask if Huan'er...

03:00.271 --> 03:00.871
She...

03:01.820 --> 03:04.431
(I'm dead)
Don't care about her!

03:05.670 --> 03:06.991
After what she's done,

03:06.991 --> 03:07.670
I don't want

03:07.670 --> 03:08.790
to care about her anyway.

03:09.111 --> 03:12.111
Just think of it

03:12.670 --> 03:14.551
as a chance
to apologize to you in person.

03:16.111 --> 03:18.950
Mengmeng, I just got back

03:19.070 --> 03:20.031
and I'm quite busy.

03:20.871 --> 03:22.630
And, I'm not in a good mood.

03:24.750 --> 03:26.670
(Flattery)
You're not in a good mood?

03:28.151 --> 03:29.151
You know what?

03:29.151 --> 03:31.950
You're the most successful person

03:31.950 --> 03:33.591
in our class.

03:34.151 --> 03:35.271
And everyone knows

03:35.271 --> 03:36.711
you and I are close,

03:36.711 --> 03:39.711
so they told me
I have to ask you to come.

03:40.008 --> 03:41.750
(Flattery)
If you don't come,

03:41.750 --> 03:43.470
I'll be embarrassed.

03:46.950 --> 03:49.111
Mengmeng, you know Huan'er and I

03:49.431 --> 03:50.831
just broke up.

03:51.230 --> 03:52.591
If she shows up,

03:52.950 --> 03:53.910
it would be awkward.

03:54.591 --> 03:57.470
Just let her come if she doesn't
care about the embarrassment.

03:57.910 --> 03:59.991
Tiehan and I will definitely
be on your side.

04:03.031 --> 04:04.111
Then I'll think it over.

04:06.492 --> 04:07.560
(Keep Flattery)

04:07.950 --> 04:09.551
Xiaojue, you know what?

04:09.831 --> 04:11.230
You're the key man

04:11.350 --> 04:12.591
of us all.

04:12.950 --> 04:14.871
All of us are dying to hear

04:15.031 --> 04:17.511
about your experiences in the UK.

04:17.550 --> 04:19.910
(Keep Flattery)
Just come and share it.

04:20.031 --> 04:23.110
Do it for our friendship.

04:35.271 --> 04:36.271
Mengmeng, I...

04:37.271 --> 04:38.550
This is for our friendship.

04:39.790 --> 04:41.151
In that case,

04:42.191 --> 04:43.191
I'll reschedule

04:44.910 --> 04:47.470
and try my best to attend.

04:47.711 --> 04:49.110
Since graduation,

04:49.110 --> 04:50.310
it's rare for us to gather.

04:51.711 --> 04:54.031
Okay, it's settled then.

04:54.031 --> 04:55.310
Friday at 6 PM,

04:55.550 --> 04:56.910
Pearl Hall, Crown Hotel.

04:56.910 --> 04:57.831
See you there.

04:57.910 --> 04:58.990
Crown Hotel. Okay.

05:01.179 --> 05:02.236
Yeah!

05:06.430 --> 05:07.511
Maybe I'm not that unlucky.

05:08.990 --> 05:09.790
Key man.

05:13.310 --> 05:14.031
Coming.

05:16.591 --> 05:17.310
Coming.

05:22.031 --> 05:22.831
Who are you?

05:22.831 --> 05:24.670
You tell me.

05:24.670 --> 05:26.031
You are so beautiful every day?

05:26.031 --> 05:27.670
Of course, I am.

05:28.071 --> 05:28.990
Why are you so happy?

05:29.790 --> 05:31.350
My high school classmate just called,

05:31.350 --> 05:33.910
saying they're holding a reunion
to welcome me back.

05:34.591 --> 05:35.910
A high school classmate?

05:36.790 --> 05:37.350
Yes.

05:37.831 --> 05:39.910
It's been seven years for you guys.

05:40.470 --> 05:42.391
The relationship between you
is quite good.

05:42.391 --> 05:43.550
Holding a reunion for you?

05:45.110 --> 05:46.151
Hard to refuse.

05:47.391 --> 05:49.271
They invited me before,
yet I always said no.

05:50.151 --> 05:51.670
I'll just attend for once.

05:54.271 --> 05:56.350
Will Miss Lin be going too?

06:00.511 --> 06:03.430
Why do you always ask about her lately?

06:03.430 --> 06:04.310
So care about her?

06:07.391 --> 06:08.990
Think there's something between us?

06:10.430 --> 06:12.670
If there's nothing between you two,

06:12.670 --> 06:14.151
then take me with you.

06:17.870 --> 06:21.430
They're all people of low level.

06:22.151 --> 06:23.271
If you go,

06:23.271 --> 06:24.990
they would come and flatter you.

06:24.990 --> 06:26.071
Quite annoying.

06:26.191 --> 06:27.230
You'd feel uneasy.

06:28.031 --> 06:28.910
Really?

06:29.951 --> 06:32.151
Though our family isn't close
with the Zhu family,

06:32.591 --> 06:33.910
if I remember correctly,

06:34.391 --> 06:35.350
the daughter of Mr. Zhu,

06:35.350 --> 06:37.031
Zhu Mengmeng was in your class, right?

06:37.470 --> 06:39.430
Yes. We were classmates.

06:40.550 --> 06:42.591
Her family is just as well-off as mine.

06:42.831 --> 06:44.751
You've all been her classmates
for three years.

06:44.870 --> 06:45.870
I bet your classmates

06:45.870 --> 06:47.391
are quite worldly.

06:51.670 --> 06:52.870
Anyway...

07:01.071 --> 07:01.670
Forget it.

07:02.271 --> 07:03.591
You're always like this.

07:04.031 --> 07:05.271
You don't take me to your house

07:05.470 --> 07:06.670
or meet your parents.

07:07.112 --> 07:08.751
Now you won't let me
meet your classmates.

07:08.751 --> 07:09.751
It's not surprising.

07:10.071 --> 07:11.751
Maybe I'm not decent enough
to be with you.

07:13.470 --> 07:14.951
Die'en, I didn't mean that.

07:22.271 --> 07:23.470
Die'en, trust me.

07:25.831 --> 07:27.110
I have my reasons.

07:30.550 --> 07:32.470
Just wait until I sort out
my family matters,

07:33.751 --> 07:35.071
I'll take you to my parents.

07:41.151 --> 07:42.831
What family matters?

07:45.191 --> 07:45.990
Well...

07:49.550 --> 07:51.470
Tell me, what happened?

07:55.910 --> 07:57.831
Tell me, what happened to your family?

07:59.310 --> 08:00.430
Tell me!

08:00.951 --> 08:04.230
It's not appropriate to tell you.

08:05.990 --> 08:07.151
Considering our relationship,

08:07.151 --> 08:08.430
there's nothing you should hide.

08:09.711 --> 08:11.031
Just tell me.

08:12.870 --> 08:13.711
My father

08:21.110 --> 08:22.191
is seriously ill

08:23.350 --> 08:25.430
and still hospitalized back home.

08:27.071 --> 08:28.230
No money for his treatment.

08:29.990 --> 08:30.910
He spent all the money

08:30.910 --> 08:32.710
for my studies abroad.

08:34.550 --> 08:37.751
We have to plead with the hospital,

08:38.031 --> 08:38.871
"Don't kick us out!"

08:38.871 --> 08:39.950
"Don't kick us out!"

08:41.670 --> 08:43.430
My father is over seventy,

08:44.430 --> 08:46.111
so I'm under pressure every day,

08:46.111 --> 08:46.871
you know?

08:48.751 --> 08:49.950
Don't be upset.

08:50.070 --> 08:51.151
We'll find a way.

08:52.151 --> 08:53.151
How can I not?

09:07.710 --> 09:09.550
This card has 200,000 yuan I saved up.

09:10.070 --> 09:11.070
The keyword is 000000.

09:11.430 --> 09:12.231
Take it.

09:12.430 --> 09:14.430
No, I can't accept it.

09:14.550 --> 09:15.871
You've done so much for me.

09:15.871 --> 09:16.950
I can't take your money.

09:17.111 --> 09:17.790
Take it.

09:17.960 --> 09:18.511
No.

09:18.511 --> 09:19.430
I'll save my father

09:19.430 --> 09:20.271
with my own efforts.

09:20.271 --> 09:21.031
Just take it.

09:21.031 --> 09:23.271
If it's not enough, tell me. Take it.

09:24.391 --> 09:25.111
I can't take it.

09:25.111 --> 09:26.590
Just take it.

09:29.631 --> 09:31.190
Be good, just take it.

09:32.830 --> 09:33.590
Okay.

09:34.871 --> 09:35.590
I'll take it.

09:38.430 --> 09:39.430
Don't be upset.

09:40.710 --> 09:41.310
Die'en.

09:44.590 --> 09:46.271
What can I do to repay you?

09:50.031 --> 09:50.710
It's okay.

09:51.391 --> 09:52.271
Things will be fine.

09:53.271 --> 09:54.031
Die'en.

09:54.590 --> 09:56.031
Thank you so much.

10:04.391 --> 10:05.310
Die'en.

10:10.430 --> 10:11.031
(Mengmeng.)

10:11.151 --> 10:12.670
(Want to go to the art exhibition)

10:12.710 --> 10:13.631
(together?)

10:16.950 --> 10:19.031
I won't hang out
with someone so foolish.

10:19.323 --> 10:19.912
(Want to go to the art exhibition together?
Sender: Silly Goose)

10:22.871 --> 10:23.590
Mengmeng.

10:27.511 --> 10:28.231
I bought tickets

10:28.231 --> 10:29.070
for that exhibition.

10:29.550 --> 10:30.471
- We...
- I'm not going.

10:32.631 --> 10:33.910
Mengmeng.

10:36.590 --> 10:38.070
I was being too rash about Xiaojue.

10:38.511 --> 10:40.391
I shouldn't have judged without knowing

10:40.391 --> 10:41.231
the whole story.

10:42.271 --> 10:45.070
And I should have trusted you.

10:46.031 --> 10:47.631
Whenever you face a problem,

10:47.790 --> 10:49.710
you only talk about facts and evidence.

10:49.830 --> 10:51.751
At best, you're fair and impartial,

10:52.670 --> 10:54.511
but really,
you're just cold and indifferent.

10:56.631 --> 10:58.590
Let me ask you. If one day,

10:58.590 --> 10:59.991
you saw me getting close

10:59.991 --> 11:01.070
to another guy,

11:01.070 --> 11:02.631
would you judge me like that too?

11:03.751 --> 11:04.351
No.

11:04.391 --> 11:05.310
That's it.

11:05.790 --> 11:06.511
No matter what,

11:06.511 --> 11:07.790
you should trust Huan'er.

11:07.790 --> 11:08.830
Trust us.

11:10.151 --> 11:11.351
Sorry, Mengmeng.

11:13.631 --> 11:15.070
We're going to have a class reunion.

11:15.070 --> 11:15.830
Are you going?

11:17.190 --> 11:17.910
Why?

11:18.310 --> 11:19.310
Huan'er and Xiaojue...

11:19.310 --> 11:20.151
Here you go again.

11:20.151 --> 11:20.910
Didn't you just say

11:20.910 --> 11:21.991
you'd trust us?

11:24.950 --> 11:26.031
Are you going?

11:27.631 --> 11:28.471
I-I'll go.

11:29.550 --> 11:30.151
Mengmeng,

11:31.190 --> 11:33.991
does that mean you forgive me?

11:35.590 --> 11:37.631
Not exactly.

11:38.950 --> 11:40.391
What do you want me to do?

11:42.471 --> 11:43.670
Take me to the shooting range.

11:44.871 --> 11:45.710
The shooting range?

11:45.950 --> 11:47.231
The one near my place.

11:48.590 --> 11:49.631
How did you know...

11:50.231 --> 11:51.031
Secret.

11:59.391 --> 12:00.031
This way.

12:10.910 --> 12:12.590
I have a membership here.

12:12.950 --> 12:14.631
You'll teach me twice a week.

12:15.031 --> 12:15.910
You can't reject me.

12:18.430 --> 12:20.231
How did you know I work here?

12:23.471 --> 12:24.991
There's a bigger

12:25.590 --> 12:27.310
and better range near your place.

12:27.310 --> 12:28.351
Why come here?

12:36.670 --> 12:37.231
Well,

12:37.590 --> 12:39.111
I'll go demonstrate.

13:25.910 --> 13:27.031
See?

13:28.351 --> 13:29.231
Remember.

13:29.231 --> 13:30.751
Spread your feet shoulder-width apart.

13:31.031 --> 13:31.751
If you can't hold

13:31.751 --> 13:32.590
the gun one-handed,

13:32.590 --> 13:33.471
use both hands.

13:33.910 --> 13:35.111
Go ahead, your turn. Try it.

13:38.031 --> 13:39.310
But I'm too scared.

13:40.670 --> 13:42.310
What's there to be scared of?

13:42.710 --> 13:44.111
Just treat it like a toy gun.

13:44.910 --> 13:45.910
Try one shot first.

14:13.631 --> 14:14.511
Remember.

14:15.310 --> 14:16.231
Relax your body

14:16.310 --> 14:17.070
and focus.

14:17.351 --> 14:19.111
Pretend nothing else exists.

14:21.151 --> 14:21.790
Go ahead.

15:00.710 --> 15:01.670
Try another shot.

15:28.790 --> 15:30.351
Huan'er, what are you doing?

15:30.790 --> 15:33.031
Compiling materials
on punishing the scumbag.

15:36.910 --> 15:38.111
You met Hu Tiehan?

15:39.910 --> 15:41.271
How did you know?

15:41.271 --> 15:41.950
Look,

15:41.950 --> 15:43.271
your face right now

15:43.271 --> 15:45.511
is radiant with happiness.

15:47.910 --> 15:49.351
Thanks to your comic last time.

15:49.351 --> 15:50.511
I bet Cheng Die'en

15:50.511 --> 15:51.710
has understood it.

15:59.550 --> 16:01.031
Huan'er, I'm sorry.

16:01.391 --> 16:02.111
What for?

16:02.151 --> 16:03.830
What did you do to me?

16:04.991 --> 16:06.790
I always saw you and Xiaojue

16:06.790 --> 16:08.471
as my perfect love story.

16:09.231 --> 16:10.910
I never knew you suffered so much

16:10.910 --> 16:12.550
in this relationship.

16:13.550 --> 16:14.310
As a friend,

16:14.310 --> 16:15.710
I am so incompetent.

16:17.590 --> 16:19.151
Of course, it's not your fault.

16:19.790 --> 16:20.910
I'd say

16:22.430 --> 16:23.430
I deserve it.

16:24.670 --> 16:25.710
But it's okay.

16:26.111 --> 16:28.471
I was simple before,

16:29.310 --> 16:30.550
but from now on,

16:31.151 --> 16:32.670
I decide to treat myself better.

16:38.070 --> 16:38.830
Huan'er,

16:39.550 --> 16:40.910
does all love

16:40.910 --> 16:42.710
end up like this?

16:43.310 --> 16:44.670
I read in a magazine

16:45.231 --> 16:46.910
that marriage is love's graveyard.

16:47.310 --> 16:48.430
All love

16:48.790 --> 16:49.871
will end up being destroyed

16:49.871 --> 16:51.310
by such trivial things.

16:53.991 --> 16:54.670
Mengmeng,

16:55.231 --> 16:56.310
let's keep things apart.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.910
In my case,

16:58.111 --> 17:00.590
I was blind before.

17:01.111 --> 17:02.231
And now I can see clearly.

17:02.231 --> 17:03.430
Recognizing a scumbag

17:03.590 --> 17:04.911
and dumping him

17:04.911 --> 17:06.031
is worth celebrating.

17:06.951 --> 17:09.350
But that's totally different

17:10.231 --> 17:11.711
from finding true love.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.630
Besides, I believe

17:14.031 --> 17:15.671
not everyone is like Ou Xiaojue.

17:15.671 --> 17:16.191
Right?

17:18.350 --> 17:19.790
Tiehan would never do that.

17:22.150 --> 17:22.830
Absolutely.

17:31.550 --> 17:32.671
The hotel's booked.

17:32.711 --> 17:34.550
Really? Well done.

17:36.731 --> 17:43.496
(Pay me back.)

18:27.390 --> 18:28.671
It's time to end this.

18:31.208 --> 18:32.870
Thanks for everything
you've done for me,

18:34.630 --> 18:35.310
Huan'er.

19:13.110 --> 19:13.751
Mr. Lin.

19:16.471 --> 19:17.350
Xiaojue.

19:18.150 --> 19:19.191
Looks great.

19:19.511 --> 19:20.191
Right?

19:20.271 --> 19:22.350
Where did you buy this outfit?

19:22.671 --> 19:23.511
My company bought it.

19:23.751 --> 19:24.751
Really?

19:25.431 --> 19:26.271
I'll go over.

19:26.271 --> 19:26.911
Okay.

19:27.951 --> 19:28.550
Mengmeng.

19:29.711 --> 19:31.110
Long time no see!

19:31.110 --> 19:32.471
You're looking better and better!

19:32.471 --> 19:33.431
You too.

19:33.431 --> 19:34.150
Long time no see.

19:34.150 --> 19:34.856
Long time no see.

19:35.191 --> 19:36.191
Then I'll go sign in.

19:36.191 --> 19:37.511
Right, you go sign in.

19:39.110 --> 19:41.431
Long time no see.

19:42.911 --> 19:43.590
Here you are.

19:46.031 --> 19:47.271
Go sign in.

19:53.590 --> 19:54.310
What's wrong?

19:55.590 --> 19:56.711
What's wrong with me?

19:59.431 --> 20:00.070
Nothing.

20:05.031 --> 20:05.630
Good.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.031
Nothing.

20:13.550 --> 20:14.390
Good.

20:15.790 --> 20:17.550
So is it good or not?

20:25.110 --> 20:26.110
Hello, everyone.

20:26.471 --> 20:27.431
Am I late?

20:27.830 --> 20:29.231
Xiaojue, why are you so late?

20:29.231 --> 20:29.951
Been waiting.

20:31.110 --> 20:32.431
Hard to find a parking spot.

20:32.431 --> 20:33.110
You know.

20:33.271 --> 20:34.310
Xiaojue.

20:34.630 --> 20:35.630
Juan'er.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.191
Miss Li.

20:38.790 --> 20:40.590
After so many years, you're still so

20:40.590 --> 20:42.431
beautiful and fashion.

20:43.550 --> 20:45.191
Studying abroad makes you different.

20:45.390 --> 20:46.711
I've already forgotten

20:46.711 --> 20:47.630
those English words

20:47.911 --> 20:49.271
you said.

20:50.671 --> 20:51.471
Talent Ou.

20:52.630 --> 20:53.711
Mr. Ou.

20:53.911 --> 20:54.711
Mr. Ou.

20:54.830 --> 20:57.870
You were speaking a London accent
just now, weren't you?

21:00.110 --> 21:00.790
You know,

21:01.471 --> 21:03.790
I've been abroad for far too long.

21:04.271 --> 21:05.511
It's already become a habit.

21:05.711 --> 21:06.711
But it's not hard.

21:06.911 --> 21:08.790
Practice more,

21:09.110 --> 21:11.431
and everybody can speak that way.

21:13.310 --> 21:14.150
- Speak.
- Speak.

21:14.431 --> 21:15.110
- I know.
- I know.

21:15.110 --> 21:16.191
Okay.

21:16.471 --> 21:17.191
Hello.

21:18.310 --> 21:20.310
Why are you all standing? Take a seat.

21:20.751 --> 21:22.350
- Let's go.
- Take a seat.

21:22.350 --> 21:23.110
Let's go.

21:24.310 --> 21:24.991
Sorry.

21:26.550 --> 21:27.110
Mengmeng.

21:28.671 --> 21:31.191
I came today only for the sake of you.

21:32.550 --> 21:33.711
Don't say that.

21:33.711 --> 21:35.191
You came to meet all of us.

21:37.031 --> 21:38.550
Please help me out

21:38.830 --> 21:40.431
to expand my connections.

21:41.671 --> 21:43.870
I thought you have connections
from the Cheng family.

21:46.431 --> 21:47.070
Mengmeng.

21:48.231 --> 21:51.310
Some things aren't what you think.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.231
Have a seat.

22:00.751 --> 22:01.471
Mengmeng.

22:01.711 --> 22:03.110
You look stunning today.

22:03.110 --> 22:03.870
You too.

22:04.310 --> 22:05.511
Thanks to you,

22:05.511 --> 22:07.110
so we can gather again.

22:07.511 --> 22:08.191
That's great.

22:08.951 --> 22:10.191
I miss you too.

22:10.590 --> 22:11.191
Mengmeng.

22:11.191 --> 22:13.630
Those earrings
really brighten your complexion.

22:14.031 --> 22:16.310
Mengmeng, your outfit...

22:19.070 --> 22:19.830
What's wrong?

22:20.870 --> 22:21.431
Nothing.

22:21.431 --> 22:22.711
Good, really special.

22:22.911 --> 22:25.471
This outfit is good enough
for a TV show.

22:25.471 --> 22:27.390
It's too extravagant just for dinner.

22:28.951 --> 22:29.951
I'll recommend to you.

22:30.110 --> 22:31.031
Okay.

22:31.751 --> 22:33.630
She's so dressed up today.

22:34.070 --> 22:36.150
It's just a class reunion.

22:36.471 --> 22:37.390
But she's dressed

22:37.431 --> 22:39.031
like she's attending some gala.

22:39.031 --> 22:39.870
So what?

22:40.031 --> 22:41.550
She's a wealthy heiress.

22:41.550 --> 22:42.590
Showing off won't hurt.

22:42.951 --> 22:44.711
Luckily, she's a wealthy heiress.

22:44.911 --> 22:47.790
Otherwise, she won't even make a living
with her lousy comics.

22:48.751 --> 22:49.471
Let's go.

22:52.471 --> 22:53.590
Hu Tiehan, what's wrong?

22:59.350 --> 23:00.431
What do you mean?

23:01.711 --> 23:02.711
Nothing.

23:03.431 --> 23:04.711
I'm just a bit confused

23:06.031 --> 23:07.150
which one is trash.

23:10.951 --> 23:12.671
How dare you insult us?

23:13.590 --> 23:14.951
He insulted us.

23:16.070 --> 23:16.911
Let's go.

23:22.511 --> 23:23.671
What have you been doing?

23:23.870 --> 23:24.711
Just keeping busy.

23:25.630 --> 23:26.911
Let's get ready to eat.

23:30.824 --> 23:31.350
Come on.

23:31.350 --> 23:32.191
Just sit down.

23:33.711 --> 23:36.110
So, is everyone here?

23:36.550 --> 23:37.191
- No.
- No.

23:37.191 --> 23:38.310
- Lin Huan'er.
- Huan'er.

23:40.310 --> 23:41.991
She dumped Ou Xiaojue.

23:41.991 --> 23:43.310
She might not come

23:43.310 --> 23:44.471
to the class reunion.

23:44.671 --> 23:45.951
I think it's not

23:45.951 --> 23:47.711
because of Xiaojue.

23:47.911 --> 23:49.590
She's dating a rich man now.

23:49.590 --> 23:51.671
Looking down upon us now.

23:51.951 --> 23:53.431
When did that happen?

24:02.031 --> 24:03.150
Hello, everyone.

24:03.350 --> 24:04.390
Long time no see.

24:08.590 --> 24:09.390
A luxury bag.

24:11.150 --> 24:11.711
Look.

24:15.870 --> 24:17.310
She's so elegant now.

24:18.310 --> 24:19.350
Did you see that bag?

24:19.991 --> 24:21.310
- So overwhelming.
- So wealthy.

24:27.110 --> 24:29.590
Dating a rich man really changes you.

24:30.711 --> 24:31.711
You talk too much.

24:33.431 --> 24:34.431
Is everything ready?

24:34.951 --> 24:35.751
Everyone,

24:36.310 --> 24:39.031
I propose we all toast to Xiaojue.

24:39.110 --> 24:40.870
He's the pride of our class.

24:41.191 --> 24:43.070
He worked hard to complete

24:43.191 --> 24:44.231
his studies abroad

24:44.431 --> 24:45.711
relying on his own abilities.

24:45.830 --> 24:47.431
Xiaojue, well done!

24:47.431 --> 24:48.711
- Good.
- Come on.

24:48.711 --> 24:49.830
Let's toast to Xiaojue.

24:50.031 --> 24:51.951
Come on, everyone, toast to Xiaojue.

24:51.951 --> 24:53.031
- Together.
- Come on.

24:53.711 --> 24:55.271
- Come on.
- Come on.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.310
Sit.

25:09.310 --> 25:09.928
Sit.

25:12.711 --> 25:14.191
Let me say something.

25:14.471 --> 25:16.271
We've all been old classmates for years.

25:16.271 --> 25:17.790
I'll skip the flattery.

25:18.110 --> 25:19.350
Studying abroad for seven years

25:20.231 --> 25:21.630
wasn't easy at all.

25:21.671 --> 25:23.231
I lost count of how many dishes

25:23.630 --> 25:25.511
I scrubbed and bowls I washed

25:25.511 --> 25:26.431
to get here today.

25:27.310 --> 25:28.630
It forged me

25:29.390 --> 25:30.671
into someone who never quits.

25:31.110 --> 25:32.711
But you still got dumped.

25:33.471 --> 25:35.511
Xiaojue has a promising future.

25:35.830 --> 25:37.511
He's totally different

25:37.511 --> 25:38.590
from those dating rich men.

25:38.951 --> 25:40.951
Dating a rich man is risky.

25:40.951 --> 25:43.070
Once the rich man disgusts her,

25:43.070 --> 25:44.310
she might get dumped.

25:44.911 --> 25:46.590
She would lose everything.

25:47.711 --> 25:48.830
Exactly.

25:49.550 --> 25:51.431
- Everyone.
- Let's wait and see.

25:53.870 --> 25:54.590
I know

25:55.431 --> 25:57.350
you all care about
my relationship with Huan'er.

25:58.070 --> 25:59.031
Now,

26:00.471 --> 26:03.431
Huan'er has made her choice

26:03.431 --> 26:04.790
and found her love.

26:05.191 --> 26:06.070
I'm really happy.

26:08.031 --> 26:09.711
Huan'er.

26:12.951 --> 26:13.870
We'd been together

26:13.870 --> 26:15.231
for seven years.

26:16.911 --> 26:18.431
We shared many wonderful memories.

26:20.310 --> 26:21.431
I'm very grateful.

26:22.550 --> 26:25.150
Let's end this now.

26:26.310 --> 26:27.671
Whether we

26:27.830 --> 26:28.991
end up together or not,

26:30.231 --> 26:31.191
I wish you happiness.

26:33.110 --> 26:35.110
- How magnanimous!
- How touching!

26:35.350 --> 26:36.951
How can we end this now?

26:38.191 --> 26:39.070
Ou Xiaojue.

26:40.231 --> 26:42.070
That water I splashed on you

26:42.350 --> 26:43.590
wasn't enough?

26:47.231 --> 26:48.431
- Splashed water?
- What does it mean?

26:50.390 --> 26:51.031
Mengmeng.

26:51.630 --> 26:52.616
Turn on the projector.

26:57.384 --> 26:57.951
(Expulsion Notice of Ou Xiaojue)

26:57.951 --> 27:00.310
Everyone, please look at the big screen.

27:02.630 --> 27:03.630
What's this?

27:03.630 --> 27:04.296
Look.

27:05.070 --> 27:07.150
This is the Expulsion Notice

27:07.150 --> 27:08.711
showing Ou Xiaojue was expelled

27:09.191 --> 27:10.790
for failing grades.

27:11.671 --> 27:13.110
Expulsion?

27:13.110 --> 27:14.390
- Why?
- Xiaojue.

27:16.552 --> 27:18.110
His English just now was spot on.

27:18.110 --> 27:19.711
- Yes, what happened?
- He's so decent.

27:20.550 --> 27:22.550
How did you suddenly become

27:22.550 --> 27:23.711
a returned elite?

27:25.911 --> 27:27.070
You want to slander me?

27:27.711 --> 27:29.711
Faking a piece of paper like this
is easy.

27:30.830 --> 27:31.711
Fake?

27:38.191 --> 27:39.110
What about this?

27:41.711 --> 27:44.630
This is my bank transfer history,

27:44.951 --> 27:47.176
showing I sent you
the money I earned from working hard.

27:51.830 --> 27:53.191
Hurry! Let me see.

27:53.590 --> 27:54.630
Stop eating.

27:56.431 --> 27:58.271
- Let me see!
- So much money!

27:58.271 --> 27:58.951
Let me see.

28:00.150 --> 28:01.191
Oh my, Xiaojue.

28:01.310 --> 28:01.830
Exactly.

28:01.830 --> 28:02.671
You said you earned

28:02.671 --> 28:03.550
the money by working.

28:03.550 --> 28:04.550
Didn't you study abroad?

28:04.550 --> 28:05.830
Xiaojue, give us an explanation.

28:05.830 --> 28:06.671
Exactly.

28:13.711 --> 28:14.550
I admit it.

28:15.751 --> 28:16.991
When I was at my lowest,

28:16.991 --> 28:18.070
I borrowed money from you.

28:18.431 --> 28:19.431
But we agreed

28:19.830 --> 28:21.471
it was a loan, and

28:23.310 --> 28:24.711
I've already paid you back.

28:26.191 --> 28:27.310
You paid me back?

28:29.070 --> 28:29.790
(Mr. Lin,)

28:30.390 --> 28:32.431
(I've borrowed a lot
from Huan'er over the years.)

28:32.751 --> 28:34.110
(She helped me a lot.)

28:34.110 --> 28:34.951
(I'm very grateful.)

28:35.951 --> 28:37.070
(This card)

28:37.350 --> 28:39.110
(is me
returning the principal and interest.)

28:39.671 --> 28:40.991
(Please, you must accept it.)

28:41.830 --> 28:42.951
(It totals 200,000 yuan.)

28:45.350 --> 28:47.431
He's repaid the money.

28:47.431 --> 28:49.031
He's repaid the money.

28:49.031 --> 28:49.608
Right.

28:49.608 --> 28:50.150
Xiaojue.

28:50.150 --> 28:51.911
I knew Xiaojue isn't that kind of guy.

28:52.671 --> 28:54.390
How could he possibly live off a woman?

28:54.550 --> 28:56.191
Xiaojue has paid you back.

28:56.231 --> 28:57.590
It's settled.

28:58.231 --> 28:59.511
Why are you pulling this stunt?

28:59.511 --> 29:01.431
Isn't it just right
that he repaid the money?

29:01.711 --> 29:02.991
But the money was repaid.

29:02.991 --> 29:04.584
How can you accuse him falsely?

29:04.584 --> 29:06.191
- This is pure slander.
- Lin Huan'er.

29:09.711 --> 29:11.191
I wanted to save you some face.

29:12.550 --> 29:14.830
After all, you were my first love.

29:16.110 --> 29:17.590
You were someone I once loved.

29:20.431 --> 29:22.231
I'm still too kind and soft-hearted.

29:22.590 --> 29:23.711
I never imagined

29:23.711 --> 29:25.231
you would become like this.

29:25.671 --> 29:27.110
Do you want our seven years together

29:27.110 --> 29:29.231
to become a stain on each other's lives?

29:30.231 --> 29:30.984
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

29:30.984 --> 29:32.310
It's been seven years.

29:32.310 --> 29:34.184
Don't bring disgrace on us.

29:34.184 --> 29:35.688
All for a little bit of money?

29:42.830 --> 29:44.070
What about the three years

29:44.070 --> 29:44.751
you were with me?

29:54.951 --> 29:55.711
Who is this?

29:55.711 --> 29:56.951
- Who's she?
- Haven't seen her.

29:56.991 --> 29:59.070
Die'en, why are you here?

30:00.711 --> 30:01.790
Perfect timing.

30:01.928 --> 30:03.150
I wanted to break up with her,

30:03.150 --> 30:04.390
yet she refused to let me go.

30:04.390 --> 30:04.951
You know?

30:14.830 --> 30:16.191
He used Lin Huan'er's money

30:16.191 --> 30:17.310
to study abroad with me

30:18.471 --> 30:20.511
and deceived me,
making me the other woman.

30:28.031 --> 30:31.830
No wonder you didn't want me
to come to the reunion

30:32.711 --> 30:34.830
and refused
to make our relationship public.

30:36.070 --> 30:37.870
So you've been lying.

30:42.630 --> 30:45.630
(If you're looking for me,
it must be somewhat serious.)

30:52.911 --> 30:54.070
What does this mean?

30:54.671 --> 30:56.031
This is an empty bank card.

30:56.431 --> 30:58.191
Ou Xiaojue will mention it to you soon

30:58.711 --> 30:59.711
and you'll need it.

31:10.830 --> 31:12.711
I gave you this
for your father's treatment.

31:12.711 --> 31:14.590
Why is it
in Lin Huan'er's father's hands?

31:16.830 --> 31:18.830
You tricked me into giving you money
to repay her,

31:20.070 --> 31:21.431
just to erase her seven years

31:21.431 --> 31:22.870
of sacrifice for you, right?

31:25.431 --> 31:26.830
You are really scheming.

31:28.471 --> 31:29.671
That's not true, Die'en.

31:30.310 --> 31:31.431
Let me explain.

31:31.671 --> 31:32.471
It's not true.

31:33.110 --> 31:35.150
It's all her fault!

31:35.191 --> 31:35.870
It's all her!

31:36.630 --> 31:38.070
Lin Huan'er's set all this up.

31:40.550 --> 31:41.310
That's not true.

31:41.471 --> 31:42.431
Don't believe her.

31:42.431 --> 31:43.310
This isn't the truth.

31:44.431 --> 31:46.191
Die'en!

31:46.191 --> 31:46.711
Let me go!

31:46.711 --> 31:47.590
Trust me, Die'en!

31:47.590 --> 31:48.431
- Let me go!
- Trust me!

31:48.431 --> 31:48.991
Get lost!

31:48.991 --> 31:50.231
Don't leave me, Die'en!

31:50.310 --> 31:51.911
Die'en!

31:52.751 --> 31:53.830
He's really a liar.

31:53.870 --> 31:55.271
So that's the truth.

31:58.070 --> 31:58.911
How could he do so?

31:58.911 --> 32:00.191
What a "top student".

32:00.911 --> 32:02.150
I trusted him before.

32:02.271 --> 32:03.431
So he's just a gold digger.

32:04.350 --> 32:05.310
What an embarrassment.

32:05.390 --> 32:06.870
He's been deceiving us all along.

32:07.271 --> 32:08.471
Appearances can be deceiving.

32:18.152 --> 32:18.790
Don't worry.

32:18.790 --> 32:20.711
It's not worth crying over a scumbag.

32:21.070 --> 32:22.310
Good that you cut loss in time.

32:29.431 --> 32:31.310
Thank you, Huan'er.

32:31.870 --> 32:32.471
It's okay.

32:33.070 --> 32:33.911
Thank you too.

32:36.830 --> 32:37.830
I'm leaving.

32:38.431 --> 32:39.191
Rest well.

32:56.711 --> 32:58.550
Round two is on me.

32:59.951 --> 33:00.511
Let's go.

33:02.711 --> 33:04.550
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

33:04.550 --> 33:06.310
Congratulate to Huan'er escaping misery

33:06.310 --> 33:07.711
and toward a bright future!

33:07.711 --> 33:08.711
Thanks, Mengmeng.

33:08.951 --> 33:10.031
May you get better!

33:10.070 --> 33:11.031
Thanks, Tiehan.

33:14.550 --> 33:16.711
May you find Mr. Right soon!

33:17.951 --> 33:18.711
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

33:19.310 --> 33:20.110
Cheers!

33:22.939 --> 33:25.224
(Secret Recipe Wontons)

33:33.110 --> 33:34.350
Let's play some games.

33:34.431 --> 33:36.070
We already explained the rules.

33:36.070 --> 33:37.911
Each card represents each.

33:37.911 --> 33:38.991
Whoever gets picked

33:39.191 --> 33:40.830
has to share a wish.

33:41.070 --> 33:41.671
Me first.

33:41.751 --> 33:42.376
Okay.

33:43.350 --> 33:44.630
Let's see what it is.

33:45.110 --> 33:46.231
King of Hearts.

33:46.231 --> 33:47.231
Huan'er, it's you.

33:48.711 --> 33:49.790
Huan'er, what's your wish?

33:50.711 --> 33:52.671
Then my wish is

33:54.150 --> 33:55.310
for smooth sailing

33:56.310 --> 33:57.471
and

33:59.110 --> 34:00.191
a swift finish.

34:00.630 --> 34:01.711
Finish what?

34:05.231 --> 34:08.351
To finish destiny's arrangement,
of course.

34:13.552 --> 34:16.535
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:17.744 --> 34:20.515
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:22.416 --> 34:28.329
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:30.126 --> 34:33.186
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:34.352 --> 34:37.804
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:38.800 --> 34:44.326
♪Until the world's end♪

34:46.736 --> 34:50.532
♪If I could♪

34:51.120 --> 34:53.936
♪Keep loving you♪

34:54.960 --> 34:57.360
♪Hearing two hearts♪

34:57.360 --> 35:02.276
♪Beating together♪

35:03.248 --> 35:07.112
♪If I could♪

35:07.112 --> 35:10.352
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:11.408 --> 35:18.733
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

35:19.792 --> 35:22.736
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:23.984 --> 35:26.736
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:28.592 --> 35:34.372
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:36.304 --> 35:39.329
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:40.574 --> 35:44.240
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:45.008 --> 35:50.855
♪Until the world's end♪

35:52.848 --> 35:56.752
♪If I could♪

35:57.360 --> 36:00.112
♪Keep loving you♪

36:01.168 --> 36:03.504
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:03.504 --> 36:08.464
♪Beating together♪

36:09.456 --> 36:13.019
♪If I could♪

36:13.019 --> 36:16.720
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:17.712 --> 36:24.944
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
